            <ArticleTitle>[Should we follow the HEART score in patients presenting with chest pain?]</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>D1945</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article comments on the use of the HEART score as a guide for further management in patients presenting with chest pain. Although use of the HEART score has been demonstrated to be safe, further research should focus on cost-effectiveness and outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
